  <item>
    <title>Ep.4 周末去哪儿玩？硬核露营的N种玩法｜捷伴之声</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/654c9fa0cf13a85698f4ce30</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">654c9fa0cf13a85698f4ce30</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Nov 2023 08:51:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当可以自由环球行、住舒适酒店时，为什么还有人在露营？近些年每到节假日，都有都市人带上帐篷和露营椅，奔赴草地与森林。潮流背后，露营分为哪几种类型？从「硬核」的丛林生存露营（Bushcraft Camping）到超轻露营（Ultra-light Camping），新手如何选择适合自己的露营方式？从无人区遇狼到南极冰川，有哪些独特的露营体验与挑战？面对危险而美丽的自然风景，露营者如何保护自己？</span></p><span></span><p><span>请听本期节目大鲸和丁先生的精彩分享，也欢迎大家在评论区讲述自己的露营经历～</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>-本期主持-</span></p><span></span><p><span>罗素质：《剧谈社》主播</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>-本期嘉宾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>丁先生 ，保时捷中国车主俱乐部会员</span></p><span></span><p><span>大鲸，资深户外玩家</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>-时间轴-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a> 什么是露营？（露营的多种流派）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">04:42</a> 在无人区体验与社会“失联”14天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> 中国有哪些适合露营的无人区？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> 野外露营的基本原则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> 在南极，听冰川开裂的声音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1255">20:55</a> 在大自然中剥离社会身份</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">23:04</a> 在阿拉善体验“一夜无眠”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> 伴着Disco与大鹅共眠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">32:03</a> 露营吃什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> 干炒牛河、广式早茶，露营吃饭都这么卷了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2186">36:26</a> 露营钓鱼是为了收集打卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2331">38:51</a> 露营有哪些核心装备？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2559">42:39</a> 露营当然可以很简单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2740">45:40</a> 越野：露营的硬核玩法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3054">50:54</a> 野奢：从兰亭雅集到现代营地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3325">55:25</a> 露营：一种摆脱人类中心视角看世界的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3532">58:52</a> 露营真的很值得入坑！</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>-制作人员-</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目策划：保时捷数字科技 保时捷中国车主俱乐部</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目统筹：陈晓静&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目制作人：习翔宇 Aya</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目后期：陆佳杰</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目运营：米粒</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>-本节目由保时捷数字科技、保时捷中国车主俱乐部与JustPod联合呈现-</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/650cfee55c88d241268702c7/luPmhkv2lOCimylVLT9aVIopijld.mp3" length="63665232" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:31</itunes:duration>
